- R>B | dare the old members to let her in, or you take your own money out | act: dare the old members to let her in, or they take their own money out | v: power, self-direction | sphere: comm.R | chance: 65
- G>R | bring her along to the circle's next birthday party, and let the evening decide | v: tradition, hedonism | sphere: comm.G | chance: 65
works: She joins at the start of the next round, and by the spring she brings the cake to every meeting.
works: The old members take to her slowly, and two more newcomers join within the year.
fails: The old members refuse, and she joins a circle on the next street instead.
fails: The vote splits the circle, and the meetings stay cool for months.

