scene U: Three other old people on the same estate had calls that week. Someone has a list.
scene B: Cases that cannot be solved drag down a detective's clear-up figures, and the figures count.
scene R: {N} wants to ring the number back and give the caller a fright.
scene G: Her neighbours bring her soup every evening now, and the whole estate is frightened of the phone.
