works: The bank refunds most of it, and she sends a tin of biscuits to the station.
works: The callers try the estate again, and this time every door is ready for them.
fails: The money is gone for good, and the file is closed at the end of the month.
fails: {boss} sees the hours on the time sheet and asks what else went undone.

