- W>G | report the climb, and write in the report what it cost him | v: universalism, benevolence | sphere: prot.W | chance: 65
- U>W | ask the insurer for his medical file before saying what the film means | v: universalism, conformity | sphere: prot.U | chance: 65
- B>U | bill the full week, and send a careful report that would hold up anywhere | v: achievement, security | sphere: prot.B | chance: 65
- R>B | tell the insurer you will only go on at double the rate | act: tell the insurer they will only go on at double the rate | v: power, stimulation | sphere: prot.R | chance: 65
- G>R | take the old street's word on him over the film, and write it up that way | v: tradition, self-direction | sphere: prot.G | chance: 65
works: The insurer settles the claim fairly, and the man is back at work by the summer.
works: The report holds up in front of the claims panel, and the insurer sends {N} its next three cases.
fails: The insurer drops {N} for being soft, and the office is quiet for a month.
fails: The man's lawyer gets hold of the film, and {Ns} name is read out at the hearing.

